# RetailSync auth and onboarding

- Follow `.agents/auth-onboarding/AGENTS.md` for workflow truth.
- Keep account creation separate from company setup unless explicitly changing the product flow.
- Invite users should go through dedicated invite acceptance flows, not generic register forms.
- Preserve verification, reset, invite, refresh, and onboarding guard semantics.
- Any auth flow change must update tests and relevant docs.
